  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Now updated to the bugfixed version 1.4\r\n\r\nThis hack is of Rockman J NES. It started out as nothing serious, but it soon grew into what it is today. Thanks to the help of a good friend named Glyph, it also features an ASM hack that makes it stand apart from other Mega Man hacks. You will see it when you play. :)\r\n\r\nThere are two IPS patches included. You should know how to use them.\r\n\r\nThank you all for taking the time to play my hack."
    }
  ],
